WEBVTT

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:02.897
an authentic or compelling story

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:05.897
and consistent output and work ethic.

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:09.897
So who will buy your art,

00:09:09.897 --> 00:09:12.263
or how do you get involved as a collector?

00:09:12.297 --> 00:09:15.863
Buyers go to the same
marketplaces that artists use.

00:09:15.897 --> 00:09:18.897
There, you look for art
that you appreciate

00:09:18.930 --> 00:09:21.263
and artists you want
a direct connection with.

00:09:22.230 --> 00:09:25.897
Some people invest because the artwork
resonates with them,

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:28.563
or they recognize great talent,

00:09:28.563 --> 00:09:34.697
or they see a potential for that artist
to play a significant part in history.